## Raw pull and cleanup

All nine `perf.data` files were hashed on the board, pulled to
`results/perf-raw/`, hash-checked on the host, and made read-only. The complete
symbol/DSO/stats output for every round is in
`results/logs/malloc-share-scan-reports/`.

The board cleanup removed only exact task-created paths: nine data files,
their symbol/DSO/stats reports, the D-Bus driver summary, three self-test data
files, four pushed RPM files, and `/tmp/malloc-scan-web`. Final remainder and
WebEngine-process scans were empty. Installed RPMs were deliberately retained.

